# Yandex Games

**Preset:** `Web (Yandex Games)` → `bin/yandex/index.html`, `custom_features=yandex`, HTML shell `addons/yandex_games/templates/yandex_template.html` (`/sdk.js`). Separate from `Web` and `Android`.

**Integration:** plugin `Yandex Games SDK` + autoload `YandexGames` + `PlatformServices` (`src/common/platform/platform_services.gd`). Hooks only when `OS.has_feature("yandex")`.

**Lifecycle:** `game_ready` after SDK init (LoadingAPI) · `gameplay_start` on FSM `play` · `gameplay_stop` otherwise · interstitial (cooldown) via `await_return_to_menu_gate` after `result` · mute on platform pause/ads (plugin) · portal lang → `LocaleService`.

**Do not:** import `YandexGames` from FSM/HUD — only through `PlatformServices`. Keep `yandex_games/general/auto_call_game_ready=false` (ready is owned by `PlatformServices`).
